    paragraph is not modified. Adobe Systems has no responsibility or
    obligation to support the use of the AFM files.

Modifications are noted in the embedded copy
(io.pdfkt.core.font.Standard14Afm): each font's header is verbatim, each
character metric keeps its C, WX and N fields and drops the bounding box,
and the kerning and composite-character sections are omitted.
